# --- QA Assistant ---
# Real MCP credentials.
.mcp.json

# A real credential the user explicitly authorized storing, instead of just
# where it lives. Created only when that happens; never committed either way.
.env

# Test evidence — heavy, constantly changing, may contain sensitive data
.qa/screenshots/

# Test accounts and data. By default no secret value belongs in here — the
# file records where a secret lives, never what it is — but a list of test
# accounts is still worth keeping out of the repository. Delete this line if
# your team wants it shared, after checking it holds no secret values.
.qa/test-data/

# Bug drafts and their evidence. Only sanitised annotated copies are kept here.
.qa/bugs/

# Deliverables — remove this line if your team wants them versioned
qa-output/

# Kept in git on purpose: .qa/project-context.md, .qa/memory.md, .qa/knowledge/,
# and .qa/archive/ — aged rows moved out of memory.md, still worth reading later.
